          "id": "d15-title",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Helix Biotech — Q4 2025 Operations Report",
          "heading": 1,
          "style": "h1",
          "tocEntry": "Helix Biotech — Q4 2025 Operations Report",
          "tocLevel": 1,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d15-s1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "1. Executive Summary",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "1. Executive Summary",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 29.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d15-s1-p0",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "This report summarises Helix Biotech's operating performance for Q4 2025. The business operates in laboratory automation, and the quarter was shaped by a disciplined cost programme and a pricing reset. Figures are unaudited and reflect management accounts as of quarter close.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 43.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d15-s1-owner",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The Payments platform is owned by the Payments team; its on-call lead for the quarter is Luca Ferretti, who also chairs the weekly reliability review.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 74.2
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d15-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Where a metric definition changed during the quarter, the prior quarter has been restated on the new basis.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 92.2
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d15-s2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "2. Regional Performance",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "2. Regional Performance",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 110.1
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d15-s2-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The table below breaks down performance by sales region. Growth is measured against the prior quarter in constant currency, and churn counts customers who did not renew during the period.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 124.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
