              "content": "Customer concentration — owner: Mara Lindqvist. Mitigation reviewed monthly; residual exposure rated low."
            },
            {
              "content": "Currency exposure — owner: Amara Okafor. Mitigation reviewed monthly; residual exposure rated high."
            },
            {
              "content": "Data residency — owner: Zoe Papadakis. Mitigation reviewed monthly; residual exposure rated high."
